erbal noun suffix"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"causal suffix"}],"gloss":"because of flowing"},{"surface":"நிலம்","parts":[{"text":"நிலம்","lemma":"நிலம்","gloss":"ground"}],"gloss":"ground"},{"surface":"காணலையே","parts":[{"text":"காண்","lemma":"காண்","gloss":"see"},{"text":"அலை","lemma":"அலை","gloss":"negative second person suffix"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"you do not see indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"எல்லை","parts":[{"text":"எல்லை","lemma":"எல்லை","gloss":"sun"}],"gloss":"sun"},{"surface":"சேறலின்","parts":[{"text":"சேறலின்","lemma":"சேறலின்","gloss":"because of setting"}],"gloss":"because of setting","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"இருள்","parts":[{"text":"இருள்","lemma":"இருள்","gloss":"darkness"}],"gloss":"darkness"},{"surface":"பெரிது","parts":[{"text":"பெரிது","lemma":"பெரிது","gloss":"greatly"}],"gloss":"greatly"},{"surface":"பட்டன்று","parts":[{"text":"பட்டன்று","lemma":"பட்டன்று","gloss":"has occurred"}],"gloss":"has occurred","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பல்லோர்","parts":[{"text":"பல்லோர்","lemma":"பலர்","gloss":"many people"}],"gloss":"many people"},{"surface":"துஞ்சும்","parts":[{"text":"துஞ்சும்","lemma":"துஞ்சு","gloss":"sleeping"}],"gloss":"sleeping"},{"surface":"பானாள்","parts":[{"text":"பானாள்","lemma":"பானாள்","gloss":"midnight"}],"gloss":"midnight","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கங்குல்","parts":[{"text":"கங்குல்","lemma":"கங்குல்","gloss":"night"}],"gloss":"night"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"யாங்கு","parts":[{"text":"யாங்கு","lemma":"யாங்கு","gloss":"how"}],"gloss":"how"},{"surface":"வந்தனையோ","parts":[{"text":"வந்தனையோ","lemma":"வந்தனையோ","gloss":"did you come?"}],"gloss":"did you come?","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ஓங்கல்","parts":[{"text":"ஓங்கல்","lemma":"ஓங்கல்","gloss":"lofty"}],"gloss":"lofty"},{"surface":"வெற்ப","parts":[{"text":"வெற்ப","lemma":"வெற்பன்","gloss":"O lord of the mountain"}],"gloss":"O lord of the mountain"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வேங்கை","parts":[{"text":"வேங்கை","lemma":"வேங்கை","gloss":"Kino tree"}],"gloss":"Kino tree"},{"surface":"கமழும்","parts":[{"text":"கமழும்","lemma":"கமழ்","gloss":"fragrant"}],"gloss":"fragrant"},{"surface":"எம்","parts":[{"text":"எம்","lemma":"எம்","gloss":"our"}],"gloss":"our"},{"surface":"சிறுகுடி","parts":[{"text":"சிறு","lemma":"சிறுமை","gloss":"small"},{"text":"குடி","lemma":"குடி","gloss":"hamlet"}],"gloss":"small hamlet"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"யாங்கு","parts":[{"text":"யாங்கு","lemma":"யாங்கு","gloss":"how"}],"gloss":"how"},{"surface":"அறிந்தனையோ","parts":[{"text":"அறிந்தனையோ","lemma":"அறிந்தனையோ","gloss":"did you know?"}],"gloss":"did you know?","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நோகோ","parts":[{"text":"நோ","lemma":"நோதல்","gloss":"suffer"},{"text":"கு","lemma":"கு","gloss":"first person suffix"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ஓ","gloss":"exclamatory"}],"gloss":"I suffer indeed"},{"surface":"யானே","parts":[{"text":"யான்","lemma":"யான்","gloss":"I"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"I indeed"}]}],"literal":"Because the rain-place hides, you do not see the sky / Because water spreads and flows, you do not see the ground / Because the sun has gone, darkness has greatly fallen / In the midnight when many sleep / How did you come, O lord of the lofty mountain? / Our small hamlet smells of the Vēṅkai tree / How did you know? I suffer indeed.","translation":"Because the heavy rain hides it, you cannot see the sky. Because water spreads and flows everywhere, you cannot see the ground. Since the sun has set, deep darkness has fallen. In the dead of night when everyone else is asleep, how did you come here, O lord of the lofty mountain? How did you find our small hamlet fragrant with Vēṅkai blossoms? I tremble with worry for you.","modern":"மழை மறைப்பதால் உம்மால் வானத்தைப் பார்க்க முடியாது. நீர் பரவி ஓடுவதால் உம்மால் நிலத்தைப் பார்க்க முடியாது. சூரியன் மறைந்ததால் இருள் பெரிதும் சூழ்ந்துள்ளது. எல்லாரும் உறங்கும் நள்ளிரவில், உயர்ந்த மலையின் தலைவனே, நீர் எவ்வாறு வந்தீர்? வேங்கை மலர்கள் மணக்கும் எங்களது சிறிய குடிலை எவ்வாறு அறிந்து வந்தீர்? உமது வருகையை நினைத்து நான் வருந்துகிறேன்.","explanation":"The companion speaks to the hero who has arrived for a secret tryst at night. She describes the extreme dangers of his journey through the mountain path during a heavy rainstorm. The sky is hidden by clouds, the ground is flooded, and the darkness is absolute. She wonders how he managed to find their small hamlet in such conditions. She notes that the hamlet is fragrant with blooming Vēṅkai trees, which might have guided him, but expresses her deep anxiety for his safety. This Kuriñci landscape poem uses the perilous night journey to gently urge the hero to seek a formal marriage instead of risking his life.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}